- \( \angle E = x^\circ \)
- \( \angle F = (x + 20)^\circ \)
- \( \angle G = (x + 5)^\circ \)
- \( \angle H = (x - 5)^\circ \)
- \( \angle J = (x + 10)^\circ \)

