     \[
     \Delta t = 14 \, \text{ms} = 0.014 \, \text{s}
     \]

   - Average force:
     \[
     F_{\text{avg}} = \frac{\Delta p}{\Delta t} = \frac{2294.35}{0.014} \approx 163882.14 \, \text{N}
