\]

The perimeter of the smaller square is:
\[
P = 4 \times 5\sqrt{2} \mathrm{~cm} = 20\sqrt{2} \mathrm{~cm}
\]

Approximating \(\sqrt{2} \approx 1.414\):
\[
P \approx 20 \times 1.414 \mathrm{~cm} = 28.28 \mathrm{~cm}
\]

